								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Gratz out to Vinceremo.. Great job Grizz, also good job Underguild dunno if that was the first time you guys took him down but i hear Corinav is the hardest of the Ele gods... (unfortunately i have never got ele flag or time so i dont know)&nbsp; <br /><br />And great job Wraith.... now that CF is mostly rebuilt and equipped.. we will be starting the MPG trials again soon... so maybe sometime soon 3 guilds on rotation in Anguish... but till then you and VM can fight over mobs =)<br />
