								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Nice to see not is all well on Quellious. you can hear the rants already~<br /><br />&quot;Wraith leading Quellious with Stolen Vis Maior Strats Since 1999&quot;<br /><a href="http://www.vmguild.com/" target="_blank">http://www.vmguild.com/</a>    the toned down ver. must of had to rethink it being on front page~<br /><br />and to fire back <a href="http://www.wraithguild.com/index1.html" target="_blank">http://www.wraithguild.com/index1.html</a><br />&quot;The lords of Wiz Cheezor were erroneously accusing T-Bone of stealing their secret cheese recipe.&quot;<br /><br />
